-demos-to-try-out/For anyone exploring the demo: when entering a dark area, which detail helps you decide where to look first? You can name the area and add a screenshot with a spoiler warning. We’re interested in your observation, even if you don’t yet have an explanati","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:54:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040660","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:55:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712780-1847286114030449","game_id":"steam-4712780","kind":"announcement","title":"From the archive: Sorting what Álvaro left behind","summary":"We care about recovering Project Spooky because an unfinished build contains work that can still find its players. Preserving that work takes more than collecting files. It also means explaining what we know about each item and where our interpretation begins.Cataloguing a document does not make it true. It describes its medium, its provenance and its relationship to other materials. A notebook can contain an incorrect date. A transcription can introduce a reading that was unclear on the page. A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:55:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030449","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:51:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712780-1846651706691900","game_id":"steam-4712780","kind":"announcement","title":"The House Measured Twice","summary":"When we began organising the Project Spooky materials, we assumed that the surviving floor plan would help us understand the build. It seemed reasonable. A plan describes a space; a build executes it. If both belonged to the same project, one should help us verify the other. It did notThe drawing appears in one of the notebooks attributed to Álvaro Llorente. It is not a technical plan. Lines overlap, measurements have been corrected and several rooms survive only as a name or an arrow. Its gener","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:45:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712780-1846651706691829","game_id":"steam-4712780","kind":"announcement","title":"Project Spooky at Next Fest: try the demo and share your observations","summary":"free Project Spooky demo is available during Steam Next Fest.Enter Casa da Fonte: first-person psychological horror, exploration and observation-based puzzles.To try it: open our store page and select the demo download. If you would like to follow the project, you can also wishlist the game.To share a discovery: tell us what you saw and where. You can leave its meaning open; please mark spoilers where appropriate.Observation thread: https://steamcommunity.com/app/4712780/discussions/0/5873133352","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:33:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691829","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712780-1843481262702269","game_id":"steam-4712780","kind":"announcement","title":"From the archive: Preserving an Error","summary":"FROM THE TEAM 237 ARCHIVEOriginally published on 22 January 2026Brais Calado When we first examined the surviving Project Spooky builds, the word “error” seemed to offer a reassuring distinction. An error was something that did not belong. It interrupted the intended work and could therefore be removed without altering that work. The distinction did not survive contact with the project.Some failures are unambiguous. A door that prevents the player from continuing, a subtitle that disappears befo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T16:30:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702269","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712780-1843481262689887","game_id":"steam-4712780","kind":"announcement","title":"From the archive: Recovering a project we did not begin","summary":"FROM THE TEAM 237 ARCHIVE Originally published on 12.03.2026 RECOVERING A PROJECT WE DID NOT BEGIN By Mateo Ferro — Technical Engineering and Production There is a reassuring fiction behind most development histories: a project begins with a clear intention, advances through identifiable stages and eventually reaches a version that can be called finished. Project Spooky did not reach us in that form. The first build opened by the external developer was not a stable starting point. Some scenes wo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T17:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689887","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712780-1842846814456304","game_id":"steam-4712780","kind":"announcement","title":"The Project Spooky demo is now available","summary":"The free Project Spooky demo is now available on Steam.This is the first publicly playable part of the unfinished project left by Álvaro Llorente and reconstructed by Team 237.Explore the house, examine what it preserves and begin to uncover the rules hidden within it. Project Spooky is a first-person psychological horror game in which observation, memory and interpretation are as important as survival.This public demo is also an essential part of our reconstruction process. Your experience will","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T17:00:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4712780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4712780":"2026-10-26T13:39:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4712780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:57Z"},"4795370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:58Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4712780","app_id":4712780,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"4e654e50c5b27a4ad643f402f4bf2196d4faf5217ed5b6eb0dfef5eacbe70104","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"이 게임의 개발자는 작품을 완성하기 전에 실종되었습니다. 그의 마지막 프로젝트를 복원한 버전을 탐험하세요. 퍼즐과 숨겨진 비밀을 통해 Casa da Fonte에서 일어났던 모든 일을 다시 생각하게 만드는 1인칭 심리 공포 경험입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Dojo System","creator_clan_account_id":45031107}],"developers":[{"name":"Team 237"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Project Spooky Demo Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790166207"